T API with full CRUD operations:\n  - POST /api/medicallix/conversations (create with AI processing)\n  - GET /api/medicallix/conversations (get all for user)\n  - GET /api/medicallix/conversations/{id} (get single)\n  - DELETE /api/medicallix/conversations/{id}\n  - GET /api/medicallix/patients (get all patients)\n  - GET /api/medicallix/patients/{id}/conversations\n- User-based access control (doctors only see own conversations)\n- PostgreSQL database (medicallix_db)\n- Full logging with error codes (MEDICALLIX_*)\n- Added to parent pom.xml modules\n\nFRONTEND (v2.21.0):\n- MedicallixApp page - Live demo application\n- Protected route /medicallix/app (login required with ProtectedRoute)\n- 2-column responsive layout:\n  - Left sidebar: Recent conversations list\n  - Right main: Live recording interface\n- Web Speech API integration:\n  - Continuous speech recognition (German/English)\n  - Real-time transcription with interim results\n  - Visual recording indicator with pulsing animation\n- AI extraction visualization:\n  - Patient identification card (name, age)\n  - ICD-10 codes display with styled badges\n  - 4-grid structured sections (Anamnese, Befund, Therapie, Procedere)\n  - Expandable raw transcript view\n- Backend integration:\n  - POST to medicallix-service on stop recording\n  - Auto-refresh conversation list\n  - User authentication header (X-User-Id)\n- Landing page CTA update:\n  - \"Try Live Demo\" primary button → /medicallix/app\n  - \"Contact Sales\" secondary button → /contact\n- Full i18n support:\n  - medicallixApp.properties (25+ keys DE/EN)\n  - Updated medicallix.properties with button texts\n- Instructions for first-time users\n- Error handling with logger\n\ni18n:\n- config/i18n/de/medicallixApp.properties (25 keys)\n- config/i18n/en/medicallixApp.properties (25 keys)\n- Updated medicallix.properties with cta.button.demo and cta.button.contact\n\n[BACKEND_SERVICE_004, FRONTEND_APP_001, FRONTEND_PAGE_009]\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nh