 Backend Changes\n- Add Spring Security + JWT authentication for Config Editor\n- New endpoints: POST /api/config/auth/login, GET /api/config/i18n/languages\n- Protected PUT/DELETE endpoints (require JWT token)\n- BCrypt password hashing with configurable credentials\n- Auto-scan languages from config/i18n/ directory\n- Password hash generator utility\n\n## Frontend Changes\n- Unified login page - supports both admin and user auth\n- Dynamic Config Editor component with language/category selectors\n- Auto-load all languages and categories from API\n- Live text editing with auto cache-clear on save\n- Token-based authentication for save operations\n- Dashboard with Config Editor integration\n\n## Documentation\n- CONFIG_ADMIN_SETUP.md - Complete deployment guide\n- CONFIG_EDITOR_ANLEITUNG.md - German user manual for Boss\n- SESSION_9_CONFIG_ADMIN.md - Development session summary\n\n## Security\n- JWT tokens (24h expiration)\n- BCrypt password hashing (10 rounds)\n- Read-only endpoints remain public for frontend\n- Write endpoints require authentication\n\nLogin: https://eckertpreisser.de/login\nUsername: admin\nPassword: EckertPreisser2025!\n\nMoritz F. Becker - Helped by Claude AI","tree":{"sha":"a8fcfe4d2000dc9faeae482404ba83a650a88bd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moritzfbecker/eckert/git/trees/a8fcfe4d2000dc9faeae482404ba83a650a88bd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moritzfbecker/eckert/git/commits/fbe6b5fcbc8303cab3a6ecd4454794f33bde0992","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158479360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moritzfbecker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moritzfbecker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moritzfbecker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moritzfbecker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h