rs/moritzfbecker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moritzfbecker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moritzfbecker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moritzfbecker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moritzfbecker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moritzfbecker/eckert/commits/75d232893cff7a20355e01d42fcbfbc83771d7f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T20:06:32Z","email":"moritz@becker.limited","name":"moritz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T20:06:32Z","email":"moritz@becker.limited","name":"moritz"},"message":"feat: use bind mount for config - SFTP accessible\n\nChanged from Docker volume to bind mount:\n\n**Old:** config-data volume (only accessible via docker exec)\n**New:** /opt/eckert/config directory (SFTP accessible!)\n\n**Benefits:**\n✅ Access via SFTP/FileZilla/WinSCP\n✅ Edit files directly with your favorite editor\n✅ Backup easily (just copy directory)\n✅ Version control possible\n\n**SFTP Path:**\n/opt/eckert/config/\n├── i18n/de/*.properties\n├── i18n/en/*.properties\n└── app/*.yml\n\n**Setup on server:**\nmkdir -p /opt/eckert/config\nchown -R $USER:www-data /opt/eckert/config\nchmod -R 775 /opt/eckert/config\n\n[SFTP-ACCESS]\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5274da614e14b7a2befc60c739d045a0ca61ea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moritzfbecker/eckert/git/trees/f5274da614e14b7a2befc60c739d045a0ca61ea7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moritzfbecker/eckert/git/commits/75d232893cff7a20355e01d42fcbfbc83771d7f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158479360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moritzfbecker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https:/