_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryu-qqq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryu-qqq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryu-qqq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryu-qqq","id":170806520,"login":"ryu-qqq","node_id":"U_kgDOCi5M-A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryu-qqq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryu-qqq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryu-qqq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryu-qqq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryu-qqq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryu-qqq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asepulvedadev/angular-code-templates/commits/9639985e7caffaf2538b4eb5ffadf164988e9f32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T16:50:05Z","email":"fbtkdals2@naver.com","name":"SangWon Ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T16:50:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add Gemini Code Assist PR Review Automation Command (#97)\n\n* feat(commands): add Gemini Code Assist PR review automation command\n\nAdd /gemini-review command to transform Gemini Code Assist PR reviews\ninto prioritized TodoLists with automated execution.\n\nKey Features:\n- Fetches Gemini review comments from GitHub PRs using gh CLI\n- Analyzes and categorizes feedback by severity (critical/improvement/suggestion/style)\n- Generates prioritized TodoLists with effort estimates\n- Supports preview mode for safe execution\n- Includes real workflow examples and setup guide\n\nPain Point Addressed:\n- Free Gemini AI reviews often get ignored due to lack of urgency\n- Manual process of analyzing, prioritizing, and creating TODOs is tedious\n- Solution: One command → TodoList + Priorities + Ready to execute\n\nUsage:\n  /gemini-review [pr-number] [--analyze-only] [--preview] [--priority high|medium|low]\n\nExamples:\n  /gemini-review           # Current branch''s PR\n  /gemini-review 42        # Specific PR #42\n  /gemini-review --preview # Safe preview mode\n\nTool Integration:\n- GitHub CLI (gh) for PR data fetching\n- TodoWrite for automated list generation\n- Sequential thinking for complex analysis\n- Edit/MultiEdit for code modifications\n\n* feat(commands): add Gemini Code Assist PR review automation command\n\nAdd /gemini-review command to transform Gemini Code Assist PR reviews\ninto prioritized TodoLists with automated execution.\n\nKey Features:\n- Fetches Gemini review comments from GitHub PRs using gh CLI\n- Analyzes and categorizes feedback by severity (critical/improvement/suggestion/style)\n- Generates prioritized TodoLists with effort estimates\n- Supports preview mode for safe execution\n- Includes real workflow examples and setup guide\n\nPain Point Addressed:\n- Free Gemini AI reviews often get ignored due to lack of urgency\n- Manual process of analyzing, prioritizing, and creating TODOs is tedious\n- Solution: One command → TodoList + Priorities + Ready to execute\n\nUsage:\n  /gemini-review [pr-number] [--analyze-only] [--preview] [--priority high|medium|low]\n\nExamples:\n  /gemini-review           # Current branch''s PR\n  /gemini-review 42        # Specific PR #42\n  /gemini-review --preview # Safe preview mode\n\nTool Integration:\n- GitHub CLI (gh) for PR data fetching\n- TodoWrite for automated list generation\n- Sequential thinking for complex analysis\n- Edit/MultiEdit for code modifications","tree":{"sha":"2464399671e9db3bf746700251fb6094fe27e3d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asepulvedadev/angular-code-templates/git/trees/2464399671e9db3bf746700251fb6094fe27e3d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asepulvedadev/angular-code-templates/git/commits/9639985e7caffaf2538b4eb5ffadf164988e9f32","verification":{"payload":"tree 2464399671e9db3bf746700251fb6094fe27e3d7\nparent 5234cf7d9d81