nChanges:\n- Replace static script tags with dynamic environment-aware loading\n- Use relative paths (js/) for local development\n- Use absolute paths (/js/) for production\n- Maintain script execution order with async=false\n- Add debugging logs for troubleshooting\n\nThis resolves MIME type errors and ensures JavaScript functionality\nworks correctly on production component pages.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"681955bffce33442bdd9832c26529c495653c0f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asepulvedadev/angular-code-templates/git/trees/681955bffce33442bdd9832c26529c495653c0f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asepulvedadev/angular-code-templates/git/commits/0bdfeb11132337c3f50bbe7949524e2d2a13ca92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6216945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davila7","id":6216945,"login":"davila7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMTY5NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davila7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/asepulvedadev/angular-code-templates/commit/0bdfeb11132337c3f50bbe7949524e2d2a13ca92","node_id":"C_kwDOQCvHpdoAKDBiZGZlYjExMTM