riptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NgnPhamGiaHuy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NgnPhamGiaHuy/gemini-latex-enhancer/commits/cd08a9d8f0e830548f7b9b8aa4c2bb2198644a45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T16:10:23Z","email":"yuh.nguyenpham@gmail.com","name":"NgnPhamGiaHuy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T16:10:23Z","email":"yuh.nguyenpham@gmail.com","name":"NgnPhamGiaHuy"},"message":"Refactor backend prompts and session output management\n\nModularizes backend prompt templates into specialized files for content guidelines, core requirements, quality standards, slicing rules, and specialist frameworks. Updates PromptManager to remove advanced prompt logic and use a unified combined template. Adds new session log/output cleanup configuration and endpoints, and changes output directory handling to use SESSION_OUTPUT_DIR. Refactors download route for improved filename sanitization and download name handling. Updates frontend to match new backend structure, reorganizing components, hooks, and store slices, and migrates files to new locations for improved maintainability.","tree":{"sha":"cb943e37fa4b4633de2b76b018b0ba8e2a2d3501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NgnPhamGiaHuy/gemini-latex-enhancer/git/trees/cb943e37fa4b4633de2b76b018b0ba8e2a2d3501"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NgnPhamGiaHuy/gemini-latex-enhancer/git/commits/cd08a9d8f0e830548f7b9b8aa4c2bb2198644a45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84061230?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NgnPhamGiaHuy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NgnPhamGiaHuy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NgnPhamGiaHuy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NgnPhamGiaHuy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_