","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDYwMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/e2c9bc1f79507dc9d95d3041cdf1c56aa466fd24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:23:30Z","email":"willgriffin@gmail.com","name":"Will Griffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:23:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(smrt-ui): move RelationInput to smrt-ui/forms, re-export from smrt-svelte (#3638)\n\nRelationInput is presentation-only and built on smrt-ui''s Combobox, so it\nbelongs next to it; domain packages build on smrt-ui and no longer need to\nduplicate its logic. Move the component, RelationOption, tests (including axe),\nfixture and playground example into smrt-ui. smrt-svelte/forms keeps a\n@deprecated re-export of RelationInput and RelationOption.\n\nThere is no message catalog involved: all strings are props with defaults.\nThe smrt-svelte logger call became console.warn, the smrt-ui convention.\n\nCloses #3637","tree":{"sha":"fe42988684afb42f7320ef3459402725c072a5db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/fe42988684afb42f7320ef3459402725c072a5db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/e2c9bc1f79507dc9d95d3041cdf1c56aa466fd24","verification":{"payload":"tree fe42988684afb42f7320ef3459402725c072a5db\nparent c64621bf7fec657157a34d5647ed795a8275fa7b\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791404610 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791404610 +0000\n\nrefactor(smrt-ui): move RelationInput to smrt-ui/forms, re-export from smrt-svelte (#3638)\n\nRelationInput is presentation-only and built on smrt-ui''s Combobox, so it\nbelongs next to it; domain packages build on smrt-ui and no longer need to\nduplicate its logic. Move the component, RelationOption, tests (including axe),\nfixture and playground example into smrt-ui. smrt-svelte/forms keeps a\n@deprecated re-export of RelationInput and RelationOption.\n\nThere is no message catalog involved: all strings are props with defaults.\nThe smrt-svelte logger call became console.warn, the smrt-ui convention.\n\nCloses #3637","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxq77CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGlkQAFeJgU6m061ateixnEURTyrn\nTeZb1sKHq6bywytjauyvnzPGnT9yr5GykeR8waipUo44z89F23sOavzlh3MSxOH+\nVS11D4yAMElZheKT6ohWwVxNvVunOimKVJJCuQp8IopsZKjnnIYAZoYwd1oHf8jP\nJsJRpc4vmX7mcMttt7lBq3OdfHmxg23xYdWkGJbG24HUtEOoTwepfu/KTJQRYhh6\nIoGVpXqpxdprqJeqwqVe6C2PFks+50aFIO8b8xbBV89IEtga2cRRRnBhSG5qbEiK\nOcOBB0x99D91eHPlwxPemC1hTASQOFLbdLhuCLF3CLlzs5ZaK9BOpOEndU0TzRzD\nG2Y/HFyBfHI2sinmCU7Dcc6FpyYDlIsGxeMWXhHNV24B49ET/zEg3mLgZacCrjmq\nc/6aRSP1WDTvuxi+4Dv1qWaLVcFJ5TFouT++sIzt9lC/D5xy1vX+vT5ji2CpCLyo\n+VyupF/jThdya+z2npEkPQOiA+xMJhyOGQE2+wl1Uk0MBcLt8iCUjxI+41h6YH9r\ny0NaqrOoYHy9nlMFy+O52OFWc/7FQra/JQoMpqgrY4uXIpthmRaaFhqso2FpFrtV\ne2pqDjhj9eDTHB10vZ/VXwHZxaSxAAVa/yrhWq12JwpBgE9a1OchATyxH2Gy0BBk\n8EMEs3M7tB/ITMWW8+Xa\n=cJLp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T20:43:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/happyvertical/smrt/commit/e2c9bc1f79507dc9d95d3041cdf1c56aa466fd24","node_id":"C_kwDOQDruXtoAKGUyYzliYzFmNzk1MDdkYzlkOTVkMzA0MWNkZjFjNTZhYTQ2NmZkMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/happyvertical/smrt/commit/c64621bf7fec657157a34d5647ed795a8275fa7b","sha":"c64621bf7fec657157a34d5647ed795a8275fa7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/c64621bf7fec657157a34d5647ed795a8275fa7b"}],"sha":"e2c9bc1f79507dc9d95d3041cdf1c56aa466fd24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/e2c9bc1f79507dc9d95d3041cdf1c56aa466fd24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/590602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/willgriffin","id":590602,"login":"willgriffin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDYwMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/c64621bf7fec657157a34d5647ed795a8275fa7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:05:35Z","email":"willgriffin@gmail.com","name":"Will Griffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:05:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: retry bounded apt provisioning and skip ONNX deps without installs (#3655)\n\nRun each apt-get update attempt for 120s, up to 3 attempts with backoff,\nand apt-get install up to 2 attempts, via new --attempts and\n--backoff-seconds helper options. The stage still fails closed with its\nnamed error after the last attempt. Skip the ONNX step when\ninstall-deps is false, since onnxruntime-node is never loaded then.\n\nRefs #3653","tree":{"sha":"dae10242bd9e154ecb6dc30831c499f045c184ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/dae10242bd9e154ecb6dc30831c499f045c184ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/c64621bf7fec657157a34d5647ed795a8275fa7b","verification":{"payload":"tree dae10242bd9e154ecb6dc30831c499f045c184ca\nparent 8d39130e045a12388ec648ae10f96a90abb440b4\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791403535 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791403535 +0000\n\nci: retry bounded apt provisioning and skip ONNX deps without installs (#3655)\n\nRun each apt-get update attempt for 120s, up to 3 attempts with backoff,\nand apt-get install up to 2 attempts, via new --attempts and\n--backoff-seconds helper options. The stage still fails closed with its\nnamed error after the last attempt. Skip the ONNX step when\ninstall-deps is false, since onnxruntime-node is never loaded then.\n\nRefs #3653","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxqoiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAygwQADRy4s6mxrtRjNiPBaBPcHIH\nR6T+xXw9MuAbZJ8DcaNPoo+/3e0iadzsbTCLghmr/qbRMT2uPDEpS8hoyh/OcwJt\nv8zG5M6JcvoJsvf