github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/8d39130e045a12388ec648ae10f96a90abb440b4"}],"sha":"c64621bf7fec657157a34d5647ed795a8275fa7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/c64621bf7fec657157a34d5647ed795a8275fa7b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/590602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/willgriffin","id":590602,"login":"willgriffin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDYwMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/8d39130e045a12388ec648ae10f96a90abb440b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:38:13Z","email":"willgriffin@gmail.com","name":"Will Griffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:38:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(config): browser-safe config entry; model roots stop importing the sql root (#3636)\n\n* fix(config): add a browser entry without the filesystem loader\n\nSplit the config API into shared.ts (get/set/resolve/clear, no Node\nimports) and the Node-only loadConfig() in index.ts, and publish\ndist/browser.js under exports[''.''].browser. Model package roots that\nimport getPackageConfig/getModuleConfig no longer reach cosmiconfig,\njiti or node:fs when bundled for a browser. The Node entry and its API\nare unchanged; the browser entry''s loadConfig() rejects with an explicit\nerror. clearCache() resets loader state through loader-state.ts, which\nimports cosmiconfig for types only.\n\nRefs #3625\n\n* fix(chat): stop model roots importing the sql root for database handles\n\nchat, events and human-resources imported the @happyvertical/sql root (pg,\nnode:fs, node:child_process) only for getDatabase() and the\nNestedTransactionError class. chat and events now resolve their db option\nthrough smrt-core''s resolveDatabase (the same facade SmrtClass uses; handles\npass through unchanged), and human-resources matches the SDK error by its\nname. The browser gate drops the entries for human-resources, playbooks and\nprompts and narrows agents, chat, events, languages, projects and users to\ntheir remaining causes. reports keeps #3625: its synchronous query builders\n(validateColumnName, buildWhere, buildAggregate, bucketExpr) have no\nbrowser-safe SDK entry.\n\nRefs #3625","tree":{"sha":"4e3538707dadb0734a6a76454c52c4dbbaf9b238","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/4e3538707dadb0734a6a76454c52c4dbbaf9b238"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/8d39130e045a12388ec648ae10f96a90abb440b4","verification":{"payload":"tree 4e3538707dadb0734a6a76454c52c4dbbaf9b238\nparent c975042582c62ae2ee0cd8f7c506d731e5daa541\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791401893 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791401893 +0000\n\nfix(config): browser-safe config entry; model roots stop importing the sql root (#3636)\n\n* fix(config): add a browser entry without the filesystem loader\n\nSplit the config API into shared.ts (get/set/resolve/clear, no Node\nimports) and the Node-only loadConfig() in index.ts, and publish\ndist/browser.js under exports[''.''].browser. Model package roots that\nimport getPackageConfig/getModuleConfig no longer reach cosmiconfig,\njiti or node:fs when bundled for a browser. The Node entry and its API\nare unchanged; the browser entry''s loadConfig() rejects with an explicit\nerror. clearCache() resets loader state through loader-state.ts, which\nimports cosmiconfig for types only.\n\nRefs #3625\n\n* fix(chat): stop model roots importing the sql root for database handles\n\nchat, events and human-resources imported the @happyvertical/sql root (pg,\nnode:fs, node:child_process) only for getDatabase() and the\nNestedTransactionError class. chat and events now resolve their db option\nthrough smrt-core''s resolveDatabase (the same facade SmrtClass uses; handles\npass through unchanged), and human-resources matches the SDK error by its\nname. The browser gate drops the entries for human-resources, playbooks and\nprompts and narrows agents, chat, events, languages, projects and users to\ntheir remaining causes. reports keeps #3625: its synchronous query builders\n(validateColumnName, buildWhere, buildAggregate, bucketExpr) have no\nbrowser-safe SDK entry.\n\nRefs #3625","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxqKnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMMcQAFspo6INSZO2Vex2M5XoMWVr\nhpABMqnywfkn8PSLVqeV0NDYYBlWf10/rlxLocqT7WqmhVjzKjZOvdA8zudYMTCa\ntx8Ubry2uSJLdJ4C7tBrWxTNkZaDeBwqBUlu56SIHm0S2APAr1iL0a1v/TDF9hEl\nkvHqjYkQqL5AGNF4khlLZQj1IkQXgJjvbhLBrDs1CzB87xGsCeZ8a3jwD+Y0Vei4\njwXvxe5MBFixfMOQAiVpB14p2GaNdz60YBMtUjLV9HfBxplYEg34xzkJtojt2lMt\n4sGmT45uaC5V5UiA8xsnEd4jgvDgYGuqr5ru81zFT0OgXynel4iDaxjyTnHR8uO+\ncsGFavqU6R4y6xiwbTM5jADJrKlNo8zbfGdIVd5uQOCXdDSibO9SRR20DYua5gwV\nhEn3nSiw1Qtgq9QatPmuRjWxUAw/KTKNzSv9YKbohxKliLNy6ZZ9+jtmw4BWtqR3\n0Hm/2gFRoSXVKWldfQD1Kb6rchRZ/OeKp8JNLZg9ROXxf+FH7p38WsAZRoX9mmfd\nd23zBsaROmYH0cs/Vu8ExSrNJqP3n8iXmF0jUHc6WAkoDRPeIWdXqOiHRb1v+5M5\ntXz0r/OftVYa/FDdBTWB/Mu/hfeQUe8AVRcrylhYkaLDn8t+bLOwQ17/RxB/PQ9M\nm3ENCmLypAeh8AchC6qR\n=PkLP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T19:51:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/happyvertical/smrt/commit/8d39130e045a12388ec648ae10f96a90abb440b4","node_id":"C_kwDOQDruXtoAKDhkMzkxMzBlMDQ1YTEyMzg4ZWM2NDhhZTEwZjk2YTkwYWJiNDQwYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/happyvertical/smrt/commit/c975042582c62ae2ee0cd8f7c506d731e5daa541","sha":"c975042582c62ae2ee0cd8f7c506d731e5daa541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/c975042582c62ae2ee0cd8f7c506d731e5daa541"}],"sha":"8d39130e045a12388ec648ae10f96a90abb440b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/8d39130e045a12388ec648ae10f96a90abb440b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/590602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/willgriffin","id":590602,"login":"willgriffin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDYwMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/c975042582c62ae2ee0cd8f7c506d731e5daa541/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:37:50Z","email":"willgriffin@gmail.com","name":"Will Griffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:37:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(core): export decorators and runtime helpers from the browser entry (#3632)\n\n* fix(core): export decorators and runtime helpers from the browser entry\n\nThe `browser` export condition of the package root resolves to\ndist/browser.js, which omitted field, foreignKey, crossPackageRef,\nresolveDatabase, the embedded-write helpers, the change feed and more,\nso every model package failed to bundle for a browser with\nMISSING_EXPORT. The browser entry now mirrors the Node entry minus\nHTTP servers, manifest and knowledge discovery, run-once, the Vite\nplugin and the test helper. A parity test fails when the entries drift\nor a workspace package imports a root value the browser entry lacks.\n\nRefs #3614\n\n* fix(core): keep browser entry a subset of the Node entry\n\nReview of the browser-entry parity change found that export-star of\ngenerators/custom-action published three names the Node entry does not.\nUse the same named lists as generators/index, add the reverse parity\ncheck, and correct the header and allowlist reasons that mis-described\nthe run-once subpath and the events-route imports.\n\nRefs #3614\n\n* chore(bundle-gate): narrow smrt-core expected failure after browser entry fix\n\nThe decorators and runtime helpers are now on the browser entry, so the\ncore entry no longer cites #3614. What remains is #2838 plus the\nserver-only helpers model roots import from the core root (#3635).","tree":{"sha":"aee9f56fc6a2dfbc88388431ff2f12097cd91232","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/aee9f56fc6a2dfbc88388431ff2f12097cd91232"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/c975042582c62ae2ee0cd8f7c506d731e5daa541","verification":{"payload":"tree aee9f56fc6a2dfbc88388431ff2f12097cd91232\nparent f8b25dc2105be90c70682f93c08cc5e8cad520ab\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791383870 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791383870 +0000\n\nfix(core): export decorators and runtime helpers from the browser entry (#3632)\n\n* fix(core): export decorators and runtime helpers from the browser entry\n\nThe `browser` export condition of the package root resolves to\ndist/browser.js, which omitted field, foreignKey, crossPackageRef,\nresolveDatabase, the embedded-write helpers, the change feed and more,\nso every model package failed to bundle for a browser with\nMISSING_EXPORT. The browser entry now mirrors the Node entry minus\nHTTP servers, manifest and knowledge discovery, run-once, the Vite\nplugin and the test helper. A parity test fails when the entries drift\nor a workspace package imports a root value the browser entry lacks.\n\nRefs #3614\n\n* fix(core): keep browser entry a subset of the Node entry\n\nReview of the browser-entry parity change found that export-star of\ngenerators/custom-action published three names the Node entry does not.\nUse the same named lists as generators/index, add the reverse parity\ncheck, and correct the header and allowlist reasons that mis-described\nthe run-once subpath and the events-route imports.\n\nRefs #3614\n\n* chore(bundle-gate): narrow smrt-core expected failure after browser entry fix\n\nThe decorators and runtime helpers are now on the browser entry, so the\ncore entry no longer cites #3614. What remains is #2838 plus the\nserver-only helpers model roots import from the core root (#3635).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxof8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFWMQACTk7ZJBl7Ul+EwXYL5mgTd7\nitweJnnaNt7lCSfBBWb0lcqKsf18zeIvk1RnJCx2Ssciu8Ax+CExGh0CePWpjJTW\njVjCVdTPreqCBUKHCi4Kd5daAucXNY8KDcu2OAhvGJcdtpUNBLn4zRaDN7dABcsE\nBn28iRA0CA+NAALHbokhpMpP/CI0/Em1rv5gQec2GlFPr1CdLlnGPdbTMgXpgA4S\nXU0GM3N+cBJvF9OSvdBe5fURmTPAXZPQ2LPC5OfFKLWSGIEisgmzSUxhsx7KTnIf\n6MEw7TJro+7XSpb2PgqluW9pi3l+nDWFCUhJeyCfMc1qF9lrYQjlXhlgxwa//TCg\n+Hhr+hk1d/nZ9WhI6Ns0w8+Lws15ZwSUK9aD1fBqjbqnGIcdGQ5s8vWg1D7AjTKJ\nH9gkumfTxq2BEa0HpAaWG8PsMqnYKOXZhQ9sJ1zAvJCWbenqQjRYIZPOAE/y6Tq8\ntDDjvtkMkm5Ip18WKeqTz+vpz7Hvf0kMyplD+Nhcd35JEREh0AbwZyns0YpZn5HP\n6XQ7ajh9Q6nQVbOc0aoarzvS/xbGPzrPvLDHsmI10oIuh0oc4DY6PdhTPxo7jWhW\nDgZo5ax2BOyf02uXoj/+28s9uyP+SecLvKJiFphsQyYh4tmazYKujpWrjGcA9qst\nhItDduX2vVpBjq8YjszW\n=gdQd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T17:57:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github