fest entry loads (a bundled server) was reported\nmissing_tenant_field although its registered parent declares the field and\nthe interceptor filters and populates it correctly. Walk the constructor''s\nregistered ancestors read-only before reporting.\n\nCloses #3623","tree":{"sha":"f4633289a33eff80da263ad06e0a4293ff23e2b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/f4633289a33eff80da263ad06e0a4293ff23e2b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/c0fed7f30b25e9d03da0cf88211c558c37dbf7ad","verification":{"payload":"tree f4633289a33eff80da263ad06e0a4293ff23e2b8\nparent e719e2a11fe0a9120dc9c91f720cb6eb83be6f2e\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791340301 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791340301 +0000\n\nfix(tenancy): resolve inherited tenant fields in the registration audit (#3630)\n\nauditSelector() checked only the class''s own field map, so an STI child\nregistered before its manifest entry loads (a bundled server) was reported\nmissing_tenant_field although its registered parent declares the field and\nthe interceptor filters and populates it correctly. Walk the constructor''s\nregistered ancestors read-only before reporting.\n\nCloses #3623","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxa8cCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA62AQAGX6CX0uAqhQhnYsmH1qoj1G\nX5HYCCH0j8MCEidDkemZFyh0gBd3FJGzKJfWlf83x7FKFFBDW6kgtT4k+6F2yIOf\nEEOvIv47rzzbN+bPVPFrZH2+DpB5+N9tKAwXbGigMe7sW+lMiZxn/7TpNPPmW5nW\n2wYBlgcZfMq57gZitqfYeGWF0H4ULJvEpOvGQpfvp49aXhDFcdKDDQkLTr8iYSJ7\n9SbL1OVLU5gkfORV1hMAvfi5Iyb5yS1fZjrUqdvOmm4ujFL5wGpgd/MRI+C32rQa\nS1ypmSHJlKkbJkahCTHHsNKRjKEVou3CgT/sG8CmE7kUG8ZSPzDFvrpJhu6jul5v\nt8Ww55E7y4FsvpUbmLX4Fu4odp1KvhTDzh4w6Qwn2KVGZu3o9mTzyr1mJuYYulJt\n1TgQ/Qq2/u/ZXTBD035lCuQrJUy4N9lAgAPUE08L4krT3Imjt9GXTw/8qb9HwHD6\nDaM/TLR1GKc7lFfcW1m+8aKN3xmuizCVmYPUNutiHpaFS68AECnCJm8N376R0z+h\nZPg3ZPZGQGtZH6CGzLeClsDx1KtUp83UPNao+t8LYcxGcAsXJQsjhhk1mhxIjXlE\ndb31SuUXjGQO9OHZIM7Q0HzdkJsbycoURZWiPqN