"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T23:22:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(smrt-svelte): RelationInput searchable relation picker (#3610)\n\n* feat(smrt-ui): let Combobox take remote options, status and option content\n\nAdds filter, onquery, status, busy, invalid, describedby and optionContent\nso a caller can back the Combobox with an async search. Defaults keep the\nprevious behaviour. Groundwork for smrt-svelte RelationInput (#3600).\n\n* feat(smrt-svelte): add RelationInput searchable relation picker\n\nCombobox-based single-select for relation fields with caller-supplied\nsearch/resolve, debounced search, loading/empty/error status, clear and\n\"New\" actions, and Form integration via the control registry.\n\nCloses #3600\n\n* fix(smrt-svelte): clear stale RelationInput options and labels\n\nOptions answering an older query are dropped while a new search is pending\nso Enter or a click cannot select a non-matching record, and a value that\nchanges to an unlabelled id no longer keeps the previous record label.\n\n* fix(smrt-svelte): clear RelationInput label before a pending resolve\n\nA value returning to an id whose resolve is still pending no longer shows\nthe label of the record picked in between.","tree":{"sha":"da655a152f5d2caaebeb463afe91e8fe408d7b8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/da655a152f5d2caaebeb463afe91e8fe408d7b8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/02979a8fb429487b8851bc3d90ba2d810c642bc8","verification":{"payload":"tree da655a152f5d2caaebeb463afe91e8fe408d7b8e\nparent 487645dded60b0b74adfe2774f40d81ff9e46420\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791328931 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791328931 +0000\n\nfeat(smrt-svelte): RelationInput searchable relation picker (#3610)\n\n* feat(smrt-ui): let Combobox take remote options, status and option content\n\nAdds filter, onquery, status, busy, invalid, describedby and optionContent\nso a caller can back the Combobox with an async search. Defaults keep the\nprevious behaviour. Groundwork for smrt-svelte RelationInput (#3600).\n\n* feat(smrt-svelte): add RelationInput searchable relation picker\n\nCombobox-based single-select for relation fields with caller-supplied\nsearch/resolve, debounced search, loading/empty/error status, clear and\n\"New\" actions, and Form integration via the control registry.\n\nCloses #3600\n\n* fix(smrt-svelte): clear stale RelationInput options and labels\n\nOptions answering an older query are dropped while a new search is pending\nso Enter or a click cannot select a non-matching record, and a value that\nchanges to an unlabelled id no longer keeps the previous record label.\n\n* fix(smrt-svelte): clear RelationInput label before a pending resolve\n\nA value returning to an id whose resolve is still pending no longer shows\nthe label of the record picked in between.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxYRWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0wUQAJ3R1YahZh8PtWgktGcCPx0g\nolimUvJqrghRjnos8qeLPGEFNetR9OWWXiR8xX0PqK6Y6e2PmCjPFk2gTUKuMGGT\n3+DDKL7X2fwBpaE7ox4fc183ekWBP3k5/s5FAQDdNCLZn1Li5h/nIT4MX9/hPi3R\nPgIx4/3xwaGJiBkcvEzIK/L3OoSNyNmS6HBv3i2k58MU01lwuKFVByTk0aEIbsN9\n1UyysFIH6HZ5nK0fjnSXCufvYqsP2JxxZL2HkVlanVzyJEjCAQWeOpK9+8+lU13i\nUwuYXve6gvzvQ6x735Z3RJBgArATdg37BTCghrwOHw24362W3hV8DSAt/Fh6HHjT\nv1Gx2YH14pfLjRXF44lXnwpBJgj5XiRgRuqhaOdR/8iacpVRj2I9UHZpB9m2Bzye\nFJCWb2F4GbedmhtptjtGEjQBKPCT9LY7vfOq5inNQbKJu8TZ0c0kgUJRLM/+ivaK\ni6CXVEbMXAFZPJSPqhjiza1K3XEx2DkPAII1/xF5CfAUsqpiop94SI5Xdtwl0AAi\nx2d+9yG7CcZQcDtLZchvylwXGGm5Lv990rZQdrP8uuqxZ/0ef9djyXIHWKVX9R56\nOhJK5Eshdq6mWSk7QLnA8dHevKD98hfZQ3igHBwJjHO7UG6IxVjA9jZAbCn7EsPa\ngX70G1owJZoEbwEDounp\n=i2BX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T23:29:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url