b2607385ed2d9195280c671f674cf6a5766f72b","sha":"db2607385ed2d9195280c671f674cf6a5766f72b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/db2607385ed2d9195280c671f674cf6a5766f72b"}],"sha":"d523ac298fc40a7dd729f9cad873db07f4156a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/d523ac298fc40a7dd729f9cad873db07f4156a74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/590602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/willgriffin","id":590602,"login":"willgriffin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDYwMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/db2607385ed2d9195280c671f674cf6a5766f72b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:22:01Z","email":"willgriffin@gmail.com","name":"Will Griffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:22:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(core): add SmrtRecipe, declared units of app functionality (#3595)\n\n* feat(core): add SmrtRecipe, declared units of app functionality\n\nA recipe is a SmrtRecipe subclass with static id, label, summary,\nsynonyms, models, nav, requires, and options. The scanner matches the\nimport binding (aliases and namespaces included), reads the statics\nstructurally, resolves model class references to qualified names, and\nvalidates the set at build time. Recipes are emitted as a top-level\nrecipes array in manifest.json and smrt-knowledge.json.\n\nCloses #3590\n\n* feat(commerce): declare customers, vendors, sales, purchases recipes\n\nFour minimal recipes (headers only): commerce.customers,\ncommerce.vendors, commerce.sales (requires customers), and\ncommerce.purchases (requires vendors).\n\nRefs #3590\n\n* feat(commerce): hide and lock the discriminator in sales and purchases\n\nSales and purchases recipes now carry options that hide and lock the\ncontractType discriminator and the other party''s id, and label and\norder the party field, matching the shape smrt-planner consumes.\n\nRefs #3590\n\n* fix(core): reject indirect recipes, typo''d excludes, prefix specifiers\n\nReview findings on the recipe matcher: report a recipe that extends\nanother recipe or is declared as a class expression instead of\ndropping it; require exposure excludes to be non-empty and name a CRUD\nverb or a model method; match the smrt-core specifier exactly.\n\nRefs #3590\n\n* fix(core): accept inherited methods in recipe exposure excludes\n\nRecipe exposure excludes now resolve public instance methods across the\nmodel''s inheritance chain, and the docs state that cross-file recipe\nsubclasses are not detected.\n\nRefs #3590\n\n* fix(core): validate recipe option fields against the merged manifest\n\nField names in recipe options are now checked after inherited fields\nmerge, so STI-merged, tenant, and framework-base fields such as\nparentId are accepted. Outside-glob recipe discovery no longer depends\non the agentSurface option and reports unreadable files.\n\nRefs #3590","tree":{"sha":"4df9826a60e0557717dfdef857531e1a59190174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/4df9826a60e0557717dfdef857531e1a59190174"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/db2607385ed2d9195280c671f674cf6a5766f72b","verification":{"payload":"tree 4df9826a60e0557717dfdef857531e1a59190174\nparent 2ebb47c6ab75dba15621a98397c32ae753d8e8f9\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791325321 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791325321 +0000\n\nfeat(core): add SmrtRecipe, declared units of app functionality (#3595)\n\n* feat(core): add SmrtRecipe, declared units of app functionality\n\nA recipe is a SmrtRecipe subclass with static id, label, summary,\nsynonyms, models, nav, requires, and options. The scanner matches the\nimport binding (aliases and namespaces included), reads the statics\nstructurally, resolves model class references to qualified names, and\nvalidates the set at build time. Recipes are emitted as a top-level\nrecipes array in manifest.json and smrt-knowledge.json.\n\nCloses #3590\n\n* feat(commerce): declare customers, vendors, sales, purchases recipes\n\nFour minimal recipes (headers only): commerce.customers,\ncommerce.vendors, commerce.sales (requires customers), and\ncommerce.purchases (requires vendors).\n\nRefs #3590\n\n* feat(commerce): hide and lock the discriminator in sales and purchases\n\nSales and purchases recipes now carry options that hide and lock the\ncontractType discriminator and the other party''s id, and label and\norder the party field, matching the shape smrt-planner consumes.\n\nRefs #3590\n\n* fix(core): reject indirect recipes, typo''d excludes, prefix specifiers\n\nReview findings on the recipe matcher: report a recipe that extends\nanother recipe or is declared as a class expression instead of\ndropping it; require exposure excludes to be non-empty and name a CRUD\nverb or a model method; match the smrt-core specifier exactly.\n\nRefs #3590\n\n* fix(core): accept inherited methods in recipe exposure excludes\n\nRecipe exposure excludes now resolve public instance methods across the\nmodel''s inheritance chain, and the docs state that cross-file recipe\nsubclasses are not detected.\n\nRefs #3590\n\n* fix(core): validate recipe option fields against the merged manifest\n\nField names in recipe options are now checked after inherited fields\nmerge, so STI-merged, tenant, and framework-base fields such as\nparentId are accepted. Outside-glob recipe discovery no longer depends\non the agentSurface option and reports unreadable files.\n\nRefs #3590","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxXSZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwAcQACuDR07RRG8TzrAMqq4R3B36\n3qneh7HdjVTBji2xXvJo8v7987QOuKQWbJELyPiMCayPAbfQ6ho0c2+/Ny4UNTbj\ntq8vp+nAtlX6k7/3sC8d1QkJKf+Az4MYP7nc4CHNq0eZ/11nz+GxNJUAev9W6f7H\nMAqfVoeFMTekMaP2MXKdRRbjcYMpPzbmbKQcVoTVImA/BpM4vCkRPa2EMqEcidug\nCgbjc6cmxJG6g0bgZnHNR10K7afi6ZjxMe8i1aU4mRGQNR2n8HiFHCEoDbN3QbbF\nHDK8v1L1le+Tif0SuTt9h1YMJNnv9ULQWeJwRZQTYePsAUOBpsTECDu1vjpI7JfO\n/GaXoz5Uu1UsBKqcH6dGRu9Bx3h/ZUQVNBdNl4Y8Yf4a6NE973hv4pl+liGlVm9Q\nBbUTaX04JnISJuqr652DObAWExAJrDZeHM6d3zWTErEYSC6cQaElgCr2KgfVqmD+\ntbPWS0ojYLxRFAxsjt2kbq+RHCHgy9nE775n6LSkzM9KxeyjKFID8Gvoj/9U46ER\nUEfLtRrWKSuAyxQI9HTmlxV9wEfo0QKy5MV2C6wLkt9N70Kg+f3MODXPgVR+UWS7\nxeBksjiMi4CW92Big14ZOLQ+Ko5jxW0nX7OD7kj4DlVQnMfBo53ppi7mMAsTpBmg\naX1Gmu6U11pwV0926iVX\n=vuv8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T22:22:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.