c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/6ed37ecfa9f50d8213deeb3e2a1d4fda3d69bdbc"}],"sha":"f8b5c2ca03b6c018539a0389e34c956703205415","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/f8b5c2ca03b6c018539a0389e34c956703205415"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/590602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/willgriffin","id":590602,"login":"willgriffin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDYwMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/6ed37ecfa9f50d8213deeb3e2a1d4fda3d69bdbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:53:04Z","email":"willgriffin@gmail.com","name":"Will Griffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:53:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(smrt-app-mcp): mount the MCP routes from the app runtime (#3491) (#3557)\n\n* feat(smrt-app-mcp): derive MCP route bindings from the app runtime\n\nmountMcpAppRoute({ runtime, ... }) now derives smrtOptions\n(runtime.databaseConfig()), bindPrincipal (runtime.runAsPrincipal) and the\nbearer adapter (createHostedMcpResourceAuth for the profile resolved per\nrequest, after the origin check) from a structural McpAppRouteRuntime, so\nthe route module needs no top-level await or shared auth helper.\nmountMcpProtectedResourceMetadataRoute also accepts { runtime } and shares\nthe same per-runtime, per-profile adapter. Explicit options still override\nand existing call sites are unchanged.\n\nFails closed: a runtime missing a binding throws at mount; an unresolvable\nor unknown profile, or a hosted profile without SMRT_MCP_* configuration,\nrejects the request before dispatch. ./auth is loaded lazily so the\n./sveltekit entry still does not load the JWT verifier up front.\n\nruntime-route.test.ts proves byte-identical responses against the\nhand-wired trio for anonymous tools/list, session principal, local token\nwith and without scope, revoked token 401, hosted JWT bearer (mapped,\nmissing, under-scoped, unmapped) and the metadata route (local 404, hosted\ndocument).\n\nRefs #3491\n\n* refactor(template-sveltekit): mount the MCP overlay with the runtime form\n\nThe opt-in MCP Apps overlay now mounts mountMcpAppRoute({ runtime, ... })\nand mountMcpProtectedResourceMetadataRoute({ runtime }): the hand-wired\nsmrtOptions, createHostedMcpResourceAuth({ profile, runtime }),\nbindPrincipal and the top-level `await runtime.resolvedRuntime()` are gone\nfrom both route modules.\n\nlocalMcpToken.test.ts drives the real local runtime through the runtime\nform over the real stdio bridge; mcpBearerRls.postgres.optional.test.ts\nruns every bearer-under-RLS case in both the explicit and runtime forms on\nPostgreSQL as a NOSUPERUSER NOBYPASSRLS role.\n\nRefs #3491\n\n* docs(smrt-app-mcp): use the s-m-r-t name in the runtime route prose\n\nRefs #3491","tree":{"sha":"2759c771bd7c87e0ce618511bf0cfc756a037102","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/2759c771bd7c87e0ce618511bf0cfc756a037102"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/6ed37ecfa9f50d8213deeb3e2a1d4fda3d69bdbc","verification":{"payload":"tree 2759c771bd7c87e0ce618511bf0cfc756a037102\nparent 23f6ed4bb621cef8dcbe8150b2078e92bdf8c425\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791276784 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791276784 +0000\n\nfeat(smrt-app-mcp): mount the MCP routes from the app runtime (#3491) (#3557)\n\n* feat(smrt-app-mcp): derive MCP route bindings from the app runtime\n\nmountMcpAppRoute({ runtime, ... }) now derives smrtOptions\n(runtime.databaseConfig()), bindPrincipal (runtime.runAsPrincipal) and the\nbearer adapter (createHostedMcpResourceAuth for the profile resolved per\nrequest, after the origin check) from a structural McpAppRouteRuntime, so\nthe route module needs no top-level await or shared auth helper.\nmountMcpProtectedResourceMetadataRoute also accepts { runtime } and shares\nthe same per-runtime, per-profile adapter. Explicit options still override\nand existing call sites are unchanged.\n\nFails closed: a runtime missing a binding throws at mount; an unresolvable\nor unknown profile, or a hosted profile without SMRT_MCP_* configuration,\nrejects the request before dispatch. ./auth is loaded lazily so the\n./sveltekit entry still does not load the JWT verifier up front.\n\nruntime-route.test.ts proves byte-identical responses against the\nhand-wired trio for anonymous tools/list, session principal, local token\nwith and without scope, revoked token 401, hosted JWT bearer (mapped,\nmissing, under-scoped, unmapped) and the metadata route (local 404, hosted\ndocument).\n\nRefs #3491\n\n* refactor(template-sveltekit): mount the MCP overlay with the runtime form\n\nThe opt-in MCP Apps overlay now mounts mountMcpAppRoute({ runtime, ... })\nand mountMcpProtectedResourceMetadataRoute({ runtime }): the hand-wired\nsmrtOptions, createHostedMcpResourceAuth({ profile, runtime }),\nbindPrincipal and the top-level `await runtime.resolvedRuntime()` are gone\nfrom both route modules.\n\nlocalMcpToken.test.ts drives the real local runtime through the runtime\nform over the real stdio bridge; mcpBearerRls.postgres.optional.test.ts\nruns every bearer-under-RLS case in both the explicit and runtime forms on\nPostgreSQL as a NOSUPERUSER NOBYPASSRLS role.\n\nRefs #3491\n\n* docs(smrt-app-mcp): use the s-m-r-t name in the runtime route prose\n\nRefs #3491","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxLcBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfpUQAFgeYyGkaPfojfpGdf5bwRT4\nPErSqOx60kkDnjm9IlNO9erSwWvefo9d1lT7d6L1CCdzys8F4UDxEqGhopqbhXOE\n3JUELW55RYM2sERvlO5gVb44finkzHKewwdp2VxaQXE/VJf+ruOKLA9ifzBR65Ri\ns5dPCHFfmoDa7j3eODM6wfrGl3yidC4RTVt1BVU//EAriiLC7mqF6StgEVqYkdx4\nTa8Ap94hlLn9LxbCg9C23oy9R4m5XFxnTRguBq891ZuBv03RrfurBcKAGLZ9Ab9u\nvffyimX2Wm2i0rkWB/rH77qhIUdY+oum1BQa18S0HVRp8UPP1g09p8TblLF7KiN6\nEWVLme8IuqN3cKf1iGRqnibi4I5oyn4NjjTq96pazFv2laL3LJ8uSAK9KSuwQ7Eu\nlW0F3JGeC/6nz9WLcZIO3zvBDLXRJt1KLeGvVqe8l//qNxLplV2UOFXQO7lUKdbK\nsrlyZxrcoJ+RTzwbAbLehMtEzUyNCyJf/no5KopI+mOCMrXL7TPeTHpp50o+h1+k\nKcweTppIrIDMdh3d8rp6kWDBvSRNNU9zucfrHv6PyCnoFd/Fjls+QH8HwJsecPNK\nuHVHVX73QGlc7xLAkXIqUbRUutrhVhmElju5F5/qPJPwb1Z+66VFTrCJf1Ljp3Wi\nKH0Vmt//rkClC+fQQYZD\n=4YHC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T08:53:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscription