er provider for every tenant.\n\nRefs #3550","tree":{"sha":"0a3c10495e1423b46471b39844aa160cd8969d7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/0a3c10495e1423b46471b39844aa160cd8969d7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/6c3e02b00d5992bdb9e9ca25fdf17d4976a1d530","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a3c10495e1423b46471b39844aa160cd8969d7c\nparent 5c86e8d8df0ec5b562d6f3fd8fa4f42dd43783ce\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791267133 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791267133 +0000\n\nfeat(social): bind OAuthState to its initiator and return target (#3553)\n\nAdd nullable createdByUserId (@crossPackageRef smrt-users:User) and\nreturnTo to OAuthState, and OAuthStateCollection.consume() as the\nsingle-use arbiter (revision-guarded delete). Lets a host register one\nfixed OAuth callback per provider for every tenant.\n\nRefs #3550","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxJGDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAB2wQAGu7Wd1zcPLWP9tftkerigEO\n7+ez1FZ7CchsT401tDZhmdxkTXtUXLJvvskIdRuDvkPe2J5KeBbSB0QCqInaPa9v\n1wOhPKy66Xh8Lfzz3xEyOIxDZMyEf5J3zx299NNssBTI8daQpWIEqrXkCE6PXZqy\nXFg4Ta683GjmiLQl7mlGBTlTeMKUur3NnGukgQyM5DiNUbgoZXrLcCpiYJkbGVLL\ncBC57Ie5B0r3qExbCOwqr1I60VOX5Ed3BLhmBBRLj0R/fE71QblnMleo9aXFc1wc\ngeSLxZxDBq4Gzqhqx85Z3ld30Ye4ThjwM9e79U5MBB/GCk/pfkFOqhBE+rRwgf2I\n0oHiMW3p0Mw98U8erYg2PxVr4YTSPaGjDvBVDrdA5sCAK3lKzlwkLzA54A9/GGxa\nfs3dOVgi8N0zczNuX/2I4guIydUkBXmOIp7l4NPovJu5jYt4h9izQ3V1sPZzNmMW\ng0DJTuCOFy5rhZdnyhfWSZMuad2XhXFVKgsqn0AE1WbGwlOGyD4nmPPgIVrPrDX1\n7qjq/HwufXSwy+5/PEUAn3AqYB9JDYkrgXlZvVsuYp2BrGamKnDFpdwr6cCzsubi\nkbirZ0Wg/iE4qlEa91XyqqVzonJT+qYCHg9bKSiqfiftXcJ8GDX5JE4edLXX9Z4d\n0EBtWsitdAE+EgxmF8dx\n=FakA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T06:13:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.git