ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/5c86e8d8df0ec5b562d6f3fd8fa4f42dd43783ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T05:56:59Z","email":"willgriffin@gmail.com","name":"Will Griffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T05:56:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(manufacturing): assembly part number, run controls, component-free views (#3551)\n\nAssemblyForm gains an opt-in required part-number (SKU code) field with\nhost-reported errors, an extraFields snippet inside the form, and the\nform''s FormData as onsubmit''s second argument. ProductionRunList gains\nonsettarget/onfinish/oncancel controls (finish and cancel confirmed).\nThe BOM and requirement view adapters move to ./views, which imports no\ncomponent; ./svelte re-exports them unchanged.\n\nCloses #3504\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f900e19e86dafa5317f17ad9a83eb2e7c1aa535","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/4f900e19e86dafa5317f17ad9a83eb2e7c1aa535"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/5c86e8d8df0ec5b562d6f3fd8fa4f42dd43783ce","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f900e19e86dafa5317f17ad9a83eb2e7c1aa535\nparent 7a3d073b90b392b615067ad54ef9b1e253138356\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791266219 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791266219 +0000\n\nfeat(manufacturing): assembly part number, run controls, component-free views (#3551)\n\nAssemblyForm gains an opt-in required part-number (SKU code) field with\nhost-reported errors, an extraFields snippet inside the f