","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/happyvertical/smrt/commit/87067162eead7206eb35aacc847e516f96d0fafa","node_id":"C_kwDOQDruXtoAKDg3MDY3MTYyZWVhZDcyMDZlYjM1YWFjYzg0N2U1MTZmOTZkMGZhZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/happyvertical/smrt/commit/5bddab54b029964baff823bed9a612e85108ed1f","sha":"5bddab54b029964baff823bed9a612e85108ed1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/5bddab54b029964baff823bed9a612e85108ed1f"}],"sha":"87067162eead7206eb35aacc847e516f96d0fafa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/87067162eead7206eb35aacc847e516f96d0fafa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/590602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/willgriffin","id":590602,"login":"willgriffin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDYwMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/5bddab54b029964baff823bed9a612e85108ed1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:16:20Z","email":"willgriffin@gmail.com","name":"Will Griffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:16:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(audit): add transactional audit trails and history views (#3530)\n\n* fix(app-runtime): preserve secure SQLite collection configuration\n\n* test(app-runtime): close shared application handles in fixtures\n\nRefs #3536\n\n* fix(cli): preserve options for lazy object commands\n\n* fix(core): normalize cascade UUIDs at the read boundary\n\n* feat(audit): add transactional audit trails and history views\n\n* fix(audit): preserve configured tenant ownership\n\n* fix(audit): honor runtime tenant ownership registration\n\nRefs #3460\n\n* docs(audit): describe exported history component props\n\nRefs #3460\n\n* fix(deps): patch proxy-addr and source-map-js within their consumers'' ranges\n\nTwo advisories published 2026-10-06 fail the Required CI dependency audit\non every pull request: proxy-addr <2.0.8 (GHSA-jqcg-44mw-7w3h, critical,\nvia express) and source-map-js <1.2.2 (GHSA-68fv-2mgg-jv7q, high, via\nvite/postcss). Both patches are within the consumers'' declared ranges, so\nrange-targeted overrides are enough; no suppression is needed.\n\nRefs #3541","tree":{"sha":"ab1251ea0732fd42aa1241735f914409b417589d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/ab1251ea0732fd42aa1241735f914409b417589d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/5bddab54b029964baff823bed9a612e85108ed1f","verification":{"payload":"tree ab1251ea0732fd42aa1241735f914409b417589d\nparent 7cad907c5e9c5c479e50f047c6b2334e1ca1334d\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1791260180 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791260180 +0000\n\nfeat(audit): add transactional audit trails and history views (#3530)\n\n* fix(app-runtime): preserve secure SQLite collection configuration\n\n* test(app-runtime): close shared application handles in fixtures\n\nRefs #3536\n\n* fix(cli): preserve options for lazy object commands\n\n* fix(core): normalize cascade UUIDs at the read boundary\n\n* feat(audit): add transactional audit trails and history views\n\n* fix(audit): preserve configured tenant ownership\n\n* fix(audit): honor runtime tenant ownership registration\n\nRefs #3460\n\n* docs(audit): describe exported history component props\n\nRefs #3460\n\n* fix(deps): patch proxy-addr and source-map-js within their consumers'' ranges\n\nTwo advisories published 2026-10-06 fail the Required CI dependency audit\non every pull request: proxy-addr <2.0.8 (GHSA-jqcg-44mw-7w3h, critical,\nvia express) and source-map-js <1.2.2 (GHSA-68fv-2mgg-jv7q, high, via\nvite/postcss). Both patches are within the consumers'' declared ranges, so\nrange-targeted overrides are enough; no suppression is needed.\n\nRefs #3541","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxHYlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQUIQAJ5tStDoZH3RlhiSQpyLigV2\ntEKK0T9pyWSHhNWTnLbkDlwGDYD00WWMMmjhGx+W6+iM4VEP5Gf9SZiviwapCexV\nqvDIFE6BaDLSJ/OO2YBbNzMpdY9NxMLHoRFDGlTMPrJJ1k378VzUZLDb7XASL5jJ\nJOk0fPNbG83TfyHunDvSc9qENjc75hsqVGdlc+qs8HY2XZTB3XvtkJtbnLCS8dAU\n+jm/nXtefbFeqI2FPB8SfBz+77xpMuWkm1nZwSrJfQoOb/qBJOji+F494maE8gDC\nzhTYCZ+JR2zm9yEGUSNVOCH5GzdID1Bkd7J6RbMCCYDI57+4KuDqE5DxUo4ZDDVN\nVeW0xFvmUMuu3vuLMsNACExfK70aLerqdHoMabV5ADRXhKmAXt+lFTQ5v+Sx8kNb\nD9hkdQBlx4TlyhK9OoNwj1L9CRfGBg14yhr+AAJgC3mB6p+mhhejeH2vETLoeuOq\n+zTGoZd0YW1mNxaIJrWtr+ClOwHtmo9Amcl0MjWRn1D+ZliA3VFyPWq1WmiBoCXZ\n3BrbZWnbExmGkiOMuBJtWLCZiFVhO2FxnwblpPLY4l942BsfXIqBCc5xZOu5T+wZ\nkq3JD3BAjOmwSc1HGfN3NhxXqKIVpP+RoXM1rKdh2WnNBguG3JvK648gV2GMqdng\