\n\n* feat(commerce-ui): add native invoice preparation and review\n\nRefs #3426\n\n* docs(commerce): define commercial UI composition boundaries\n\nRefs #3423\n\n* feat(commerce): add native quotation and estimate UI\n\nRefs #3425\n\n* docs(commerce): correct contract subtype count\n\nDrive-by fix: README listed five subtypes; Contract.ts defines nine.\n\nRefs #3423\n\n* feat(assets-ui): add native private attachment workflows\n\nRefs #3428\n\n* feat(commerce): present retained pricing versions and decisions\n\nRefs #3430\n\n* feat(commerce): add customer and vendor UI surfaces\n\nRefs #3422\n\n* feat(expenses-ui): add native entry and receipt review\n\nRefs #3429\n\n* feat(commerce): add native purchasing and award UI\n\nRefs #3427\n\n* fix(commerce): render unavailable invalid pricing amounts (#3430)\n\n* fix(commerce): preserve quote save intent on implicit submit (#3425)\n\n* fix(commerce): save invoice draft on implicit submission (#3426)\n\n* docs(commerce): correct legacy invoice display money guidance\n\n* fix(commerce): preserve purchasing intent on implicit submit\n\n* fix(commerce): preserve native party form intent\n\nRefs #3422\n\n* test: wire commercial UI release suites into package gates\n\n* fix(tooling): scan nested Svelte localization expressions\n\nRefs #3440\n\n* fix(commerce): localize quote playground actions and feedback (#3425)\n\n* fix(commerce): default custom party submissions\n\nRefs #3422\n\n* fix(commerce): localize purchasing playground feedback (#3427)\n\n* test(commerce): await navigation on repeated native quote submissions (#3425)\n\n* fix(workbench): contain mobile previews within host viewport\n\n* fix(cli): preserve owned backup destination on Node 26\n\nRefs #3450\n\n* fix(cli): honor parsed manifest-only option\n\n* fix(commerce): recover invalid quote and purchase display money\n\nRefs #3425, #3427\n\n* fix(commerce): format party minor units exactly\n\nRefs #3422\n\n* fix(ci): supply trusted Acorn to the localization scann