:"https://github.com/happyvertical/smrt/commit/07effef4b0b34253222b4790e11b47fbda606e04","sha":"07effef4b0b34253222b4790e11b47fbda606e04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/07effef4b0b34253222b4790e11b47fbda606e04"}],"sha":"bdf84f20478b8b687de21fbe296019421a1ff1c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/bdf84f20478b8b687de21fbe296019421a1ff1c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/590602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/willgriffin","id":590602,"login":"willgriffin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDYwMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willgriffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/commits/07effef4b0b34253222b4790e11b47fbda606e04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:55:49Z","email":"willgriffin@gmail.com","name":"Will Griffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:55:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: register new packages in tooling lists and stage template pins in releases (#3351)\n\n* chore(timesheets): hold smrt-timesheets to the strict noExplicitAny list\n\nThe shared time-entry code was strict-linted while it lived in\npackages/projects; moving it to packages/timesheets dropped it from the\nnoExplicitAny override. It passes the rule unchanged.\n\nRefs #3350\n\n* docs: list smrt-timesheets in the context map\n\nRefs #3350\n\n* chore(coverage): tier smrt-expenses at T2 and smrt-timesheets at T3\n\nOwner-ratified tiers: expenses matches its money siblings commerce and\nledgers (T2); timesheets inherits projects'' tier (T3). Both measure\nabove their floors (expenses 95.63% vs 70%, timesheets 87.94% vs 50%),\nso no interim ratchet floor is needed.\n\nRefs #3350\n\n* fix(ci): stage mcp-apps-template pins in the release archive and commit\n\nsync-template-versions.mjs rewrites\npackages/template-sveltekit/mcp-apps-template/package.dependencies.json,\nbut publish.yml selected release files by name and matched neither the\nversioned workspace archive nor the release commit''s git add, so v0.53.0\nshipped the pins at ^0.52.0 and broke the template and cli MCP Apps\ntests on main. Include package.dependencies.json in both and assert it in\nthe publish workflow policy test.\n\nRefs #3356\n\n* fix(template-sveltekit): sync the MCP Apps optional pins to the 0.53.0 release\n\nWritten by node scripts/sync-template-versions.mjs 0.53.0; the release\ncommit had dropped this file (see the previous commit).\n\nRefs #3356","tree":{"sha":"87cbacc2de57ec8304342786c8cc5016d78d0963","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/trees/87cbacc2de57ec8304342786c8cc5016d78d0963"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/happyvertical/smrt/git/commits/07effef4b0b34253222b4790e11b47fbda606e04","verification":{"payload":"tree 87cbacc2de57ec8304342786c8cc5016d78d0963\nparent 85801a661289ccf7e72ccceecebd52434ad08838\nauthor Will Griffin <willgriffin@gmail.com> 1790945749 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790945749 +0000\n\nchore: register new packages in tooling lists and stage template pins in releases (#3351)\n\n* chore(timesheets): hold smrt-timesheets to the strict noExplicitAny list\n\nThe shared time-entry code was strict-linted while it lived in\npackages/projects; moving it to packages/timesheets dropped it from the\nnoExplicitAny override. It passes the rule unchanged.\n\nRefs #3350\n\n* docs: list smrt-timesheets in the context map\n\nRefs #3350\n\n* chore(coverage): tier smrt-expenses at T2 and smrt-timesheets at T3\n\nOwner-ratified tiers: expenses matches its money siblings commerce and\nledgers (T2); timesheets inherits projects'' tier (T3). Both measure\nabove their floors (expenses 95.63% vs 70%, timesheets 87.94% vs 50%),\nso no interim ratchet floor is needed.\n\nRefs #3350\n\n* fix(ci): stage mcp-apps-template pins in the release archive and commit\n\nsync-template-versions.mjs rewrites\npackages/template-sveltekit/mcp-apps-template/package.dependencies.json,\nbut publish.yml selected release files by name and matched neither the\nversioned workspace archive nor the release commit''s git add, so v0.53.0\nshipped the pins at ^0.52.0 and broke the template and cli MCP Apps\ntests on main. Include package.dependencies.json in both and assert it in\nthe publish workflow policy test.\n\nRefs #3356\n\n* fix(template-sveltekit): sync the MCP Apps optional pins to the 0.53.0 release\n\nWritten by node scripts/sync-template-versions.mjs 0.53.0; the release\ncommit had dropped this file (see the previous commit).\n\nRefs #3356","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv6nlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAB6AQAA7bTDkyxxkwjid8hFW8SSGW\nPFYgCP4kVdE1o8U2mJ7mMJrlCUzSu1yTEt65q+LTQEVhO4cm0wBURZfC03RneLoQ\nHZS0dl0wSru9s6y31PQoPOfc9W+M+4DrJoAi7ZHILOINztl8yFPD6CJW3iAj8fjc\nNX8iAlt00ipHCvHE+tqbyzTakQbKVvWpJqib162GIU+2vyMXHZCBoMsw1Mg30/Lv\nvBRgLe7oMNBbG2uxPwiWony3Acq1nqTIKoCPPFAq7erOPyniURxmrXviqYURnrD0\nCA2tV/DqNYDBj1VaR7yRmZl2Mrql/7in+3XdMZ2HGWsVRQrRL803XoHGXqPxHDRp\nv+UVmjAanwzkZzciuTxx7xy5gJ113BGZUbe4D4QUGxsaB2GjTebjbED732QtFWoz\n/gG6AjUz5/bbo4PIX54y6y+MCMhfVQtJK01oj5pduUSweidHH1pmiasDkmuSHL6E\n7ShK+0rfg44Ajyw6u7XW38GRikzGOIfHbpCRf7rQKDG2RDP8UN8BgoGch1V6kk2S\nFx28YYN3B+dhmxzh