committer":{"account":{"login":"lm-webui","providerType":"User"},"email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:38:32.605Z","repositoryId":1077795193,"sha":"a20404e90bb2b1dc1fe24bdddd4aa96b91765867"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"lm-webui","providerType":"User"},"email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-18T13:15:32Z","committedDate":"2026-08-18T13:15:32Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"lm-webui","providerType":"User"},"email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:38:32.605Z","repositoryId":1077795193,"sha":"0b5c8458d4a08921e488a49a9af1a67d480e3d98"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"lm-webui","providerType":"User"},"email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-18T09:51:06Z","committedDate":"2026-08-18T09:51:06Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"lm-webui","providerType":"User"},"email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:38:32.605Z","repositoryId":1077795193,"sha":"6509d3e1c7372bc223e44d6e6ed434abe38b6747"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"lm-webui","providerType":"User"},"email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-18T02:30:52Z","committedDate":"2026-08-18T02:30:52Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"lm-webui","providerType":"User"},"email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:38:32.605Z","repositoryId":1077795193,"sha":"760af6903918fafc61b7b85bf5ad9d15bd2468db"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"lm-webui","providerType":"User"},"email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-18T02:30:43Z","committedDate":"2026-08-18T02:30:43Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"lm-webui","providerType":"User"},"email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:38:32.605Z","repositoryId":1077795193,"sha":"8d67caa5ed5fb97b7ed1bb27dd83cbc86053d5e8"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:38:32.605Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238521552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lm-webui","id":238521552,"login":"lm-webui","node_id":"U_kgDODjeM0A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lm-webui","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lm-webui/lm-webui/commits/2918e92e26df11ab00f59715cb8a779d6e73dc1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:35:18Z","email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:35:18Z","email":"lmwebui@gmail.com","name":"lm-webui"},"message":"Migrate Gemini pipeline to google-genai, accept AQ. keys, drop imagen\n\nThe chat provider already used the unified `google-genai` SDK, but the package\nwas never declared: it was missing from both requirements.txt and the lock that\ninstall.sh installs from, so a fresh install had no `google` module and every\nGemini call died on import. Fixes that and the three assumptions the port left\nbehind.\n\nDependencies:\n- declare google-genai and regenerate the lock. The lock had also drifted from\n  requirements.txt on its own — faster-whisper, rapidocr, ddgs, yt-dlp and\n  others were declared but absent, so installs were silently incomplete.\n  google-genai requires websockets<17, which is why the lock moved 17.0.1 to\n  16.1.1; nothing in the backend imports websockets directly.\n\nProvider (app/providers/remote/gemini.py):\n- types.GenerateContentConfig instead of a plain dict\n- real streaming: client.aio yields each chunk as its own token event. The\n  previous sync call ran in a thread pool and concatenated everything into one\n  string, so the client received the whole answer as a single event.\n- list_models filters on supported_actions instead of `\"gemini\" in name`. The\n  name check hid the gemini-*-image models, which is why the dynamic image-model\n  fetch could never return anything.\n\nImage service (app/services/gemini_image.py):\n- rewritten on the SDK. The key no longer travels as a `?key=` URL parameter,\n  and both AIza traffic strings and AQ. auth tokens work because the SDK picks\n  the auth mechanism — nothing here parses the key.\n\nKeys:\n- the API-keys UI accepted only `AIza`-prefixed keys, so a current key could not\n  be saved. It now accepts AIza or AQ.\n- GEMINI_API_KEY is recognized alongside GOOGLE_API_KEY.\n\nimagen:\n- no longer served by the Gemini API. Removed from the image-model list, the\n  keyword matchers that select it, and the `predict` capability branch that only\n  it used. The gemini-*-image models are unaffected.\n\nHardcoded models:\n- the cloud image-model fallback lists are gone; models come from the\n  provider''s own list API, and an empty list is returned when there is no key.\n- kept deliberately: Anthropic''s static list (no model-list endpoint exists) and\n  the ComfyUI/GGUF catalog (downloadable files, not API-listed models).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd3d43d90e1ccb7a553fed42c508cceef7722122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lm-webui/lm-webui/git/trees/dd3d43d90e1ccb7a553fed42c508cceef7722122"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lm-webui/lm-webui/git/commits/2918e92e26df11ab00f59715cb8a779d6e73dc1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url"