ist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Artifizer/HAI3/commits/04505645c549a3229763881b9baee67bbc8b0f76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T20:15:05Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T06:19:25Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"test(cli): add PR e2e coverage for scaffolded projects\n\nAdd dedicated GitHub Actions workflows for CLI verification:\n- new required PR check cli-pr-e2e on Node 24.14.x\n- new nightly/manual CLI e2e workflow with broader scenario coverage\n\nAdd reusable CLI e2e runners:\n- shared harness with step logs and JSON summaries\n- PR smoke scenario covering create, install, build, type-check,\n  validate, scaffold layout, and ai sync\n- nightly scenario covering custom UIKit, layer scaffolds, migrate,\n  invalid-name rejection, and ai sync idempotency\n\nHarden generated project templates to make the scaffold path verifiable:\n- initialize git before install in e2e flow to satisfy postinstall\n- fix generated MFE manifest typing for empty registries\n- fix bootstrap type issues so fresh projects pass type-check\n\nDocument local CLI verification and required branch-protection checks\nin CONTRIBUTING.md.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"8584b9767617e2e1be92ba5e9f4de515931937c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos