","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Artifizer/HAI3/commits/bbca61a525f6e8f040d56ca7e9f7351f0e957997/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T16:23:19Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T07:57:32Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(cli): address PR review — remove registry.ts, dynamic bootstrap, MFE scaffold fixes\n\nPR review identified 3 critical and 4 warning issues in the MFE infrastructure.\nAll issues resolved in one commit:\n\nC1+W2: Delete src/app/mfe/registry.ts (architecturally redundant, never consumed\nat runtime). Rewrite scripts/dev-all.ts to scan src/mfe_packages/*/package.json\ndirectly for port discovery via --port in preview/dev scripts.\n\nC2: Rewrite src/app/mfe/bootstrap.ts — dynamic loop over MFE_MANIFESTS from\n./generated-mfe-manifests; empty-registry guard; fix screenExtensions[0] crash\non empty array.\n\nC3/W1: Update .ai/GUIDELINES.md dep invariant — standalone projects must declare\nL1/L2 peer deps explicitly (@hai3/framework, @hai3/api, @hai3/i18n, @hai3/screensets,\n@hai3/state).\n\nW3: Add src/app/mfe/generated-mfe-manifests.ts to .gitignore; remove from git index.\n\nW4: Sync OpenSpec artifacts — tasks.md reflects dropped registry.ts approach;\ndesign.md removes registry.ts from bootstrap flow and file map.\n\nCLI scaffold fixes (P2.3):\n- Add packages/cli/template-sources/project/src/app/mfe/ (bootstrap.ts + stub)\n- Add packages/cli/template-sources/project/scripts/ (dev-all.ts, generate-mfe-manifests.ts)\n- Add src/app/mfe to manifest.yaml directories → included in stage1b.directories\n- Update project.ts: add generate:mfe-manifests, dev:all; prepend to dev/build/type-check\n\nhai3-new-mfe agent visibility (P2.5):\n- Add packages/react/commands/hai3-new-mfe.md (bundled into generated projects)\n- Add .claude/commands/hai3-new-mfe.md, .cursor/commands/, .windsurf/workflows/\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"65d76741d6451822e0286769333b8ee034c25656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Artifizer/HAI3/git/trees/65d76741d6451822e0286769333b8ee034c25656"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Artifizer/HAI3/git/commits/bbca61a525f6e8f040d56ca7e9f7351f0e957997","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer/HAI3/commit/bbca61a525f6e8f040d56ca7e9f7351f0e957997","node_id":"C_kwDOQD-UHtoAKGJiY2E2MWE1MjVmNmU4ZjA0MGQ1NmNhN2U5ZjczNTFmMGU5NTc5OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer/HAI3/commit/3d85dc9a403b49d83dd7f8e366769642da03026c","sha":"3d85dc9a403b49d83dd7f8e366769642da03026c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Artifizer/HAI3/commits/3d85dc9a403b49d83dd7f8e366769642da03026c"}],"sha":"bbca61a525f6e8f040d56ca7e9f7351f0e957997","url":"https://ap