700c27adde857ebe094c71cb832","node_id":"C_kwDOQELQTNoAKDIwMTdjOWIwY2ZkZTM3MDBjMjdhZGRlODU3ZWJlMDk0YzcxY2I4MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commit/3677ec616b31010164f49d29d7b90ec1de9b3d22","sha":"3677ec616b31010164f49d29d7b90ec1de9b3d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/3677ec616b31010164f49d29d7b90ec1de9b3d22"}],"sha":"2017c9b0cfde3700c27adde857ebe094c71cb832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/2017c9b0cfde3700c27adde857ebe094c71cb832"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/3677ec616b31010164f49d29d7b90ec1de9b3d22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T12:18:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T12:18:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: enforce report file creation in Phase 5\n\nMake Phase 5 report generation explicitly save to file in project root to ensure reports are always persisted.\n\n**Changes to Phase 5 (Report Generation):**\n\n1. Detailed Report Generation Steps\n   - Step 1: Collect all data from phases 1-4\n   - Step 2: Format report using markdown structure\n   - Step 3: Create filename with format: DEPENDENCY_HEALTH_REPORT_YYYY-MM-DD.md\n   - Step 4: CRITICAL - Save report to project root using Write tool\n   - Step 5: Verify file creation with ls command\n   - Step 6: Confirm to user with full file path\n\n2. Mandatory File Creation\n   - Report MUST be saved as file (not optional)\n   - Location: Project root directory (same level as package.json)\n   - Filename format: DEPENDENCY_HEALTH_REPORT_YYYY-MM-DD.md\n   - Always verify file was created successfully\n\n3. Example Implementation\n   - Added step-by-step bash example showing:\n     - Getting current date for filename\n     - Getting working directory for path\n     - Using Write tool to create file\n     - Verifying file creation\n     - Confirming to user\n\n4. Error Handling\n   - Added error scenario #10: Report file cannot be created\n   - Check write permissions\n   - Verify working directory\n   - Try absolute path\n   - Fallback: Display report and ask user to save manually\n\n5. Updated Documentation\n   - Tool Usage: Added Phase 5 report commands (date, ls, pwd)\n   - Success Criteria: Added report file creation verification\n   - Final Checklist: Added report file creation and verification items\n   - Response Approach: Updated Phase 5 description\n\nThis ensures the report is always saved to a file and never lost, addressing the issue where \"sometimes it saves and sometimes it doesn''t\".\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72e66c40754ee4ae22d555462511be09277a2115","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/trees/72e66c40754ee4ae22d555462511be09277a2115"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/commits/3677ec616b31010164f49d29d7b90ec1de9b3d22","verification":{"payload":"tree 72e66c40754ee4ae22d555462511be09277a2115\nparent 8b1bb8c1462b7cedbed256d46e8894ae5869beb5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761221904 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761221904 +0000\n\nfeat: enforce report file creation in Phase 5\n\nMake Phase 5 report generation explicitly save to file in project root to ensure reports are always persisted.\n\n**Changes to Phase 5 (Report Generation):**\n\n1. Detailed Report Generation Steps\n   - Step 1: Collect all data from phases 1-4\n   - Step 2: Format report using markdown structure\n   - Step 3: Create filename with format: DEPENDENCY_HEALTH_REPORT_YYYY-MM-DD.md\n   - Step 4: CRITICAL - Save report to project root using Write tool\n   - Step 5: Verify file creation with ls command\n   - Step 6: Confirm to user with full file path\n\n2. Mandatory File Creation\n   - Report MUST be saved as file (not optional)\n   - Location: Project root directory (same level as package.json)\n   - Filename format: DEPENDENCY_HEALTH_REPORT_YYYY-MM-DD.md\n   - Always verify file was created successfully\n\n3. Example Implementation\n   - Added step-by-step bash example showing:\n     - Getting current date for filename\n     - Getting working directory for path\n     - Using Write tool to create file\n     - Verifying file creation\n     - Confirming to user\n\n4. Error Handling\n   - Added error scenario #10: Report file cannot be created\n   - Check write permissions\n   - Verify working directory\n   - Try absolute path\n   - Fallback: Display report and ask user to save manually\n\n5. Updated Documentation\n   - Tool Usage: Added Phase 5 report commands (date, ls, pwd)\n   - Success Criteria: Added report file creation verification\n   - Final Checklist: Added report file creation and verification items\n   - Response Approach: Updated Phase 5 description\n\nThis ensures the report is always saved to a file and never lost, addressing the issue where \"sometimes it saves and sometimes it doesn''t\".\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKX7V8bX\nFEhcizNj4i4b26wU+lt/nX1sMJcJrdPJPyWlRsCR9xpeyHpBvdzXI7j7Y/0J6qRrM41GDp2Y8mAX\n1gY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-23T12:18:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commit/3677ec616b31010164f49d29d7b90ec1de9b3d22","node_id":"C_kwDOQELQTNoAKDM2NzdlYzYxNmIzMTAxMDE2NGY0OWQyOWQ3YjkwZWMxZGU5YjNkMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commit/8b1bb8c1462b7cedbed256d46e8894ae5869beb5","sha":"8b1bb8c1462b7cedbed256d46e8894ae5869beb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/8b1bb8c1462b7cedbed256d46e8894ae5869beb5"}],"sha":"3677ec616b31010164f49d29d7b90ec1de9b3d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/3677ec616b31010164f49d29d7b90ec1de9b3d22"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/8b1bb8c1462b7cedbed256d46e8894ae5869beb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T12:14:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T12:14:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: add verification phase with npm install, linting, and build checks\n\nAdd Phase 4 (Installation, Linting, and Build Verification) to dependency health checker agent:\n\n**New Phase 4 Workflow:**\n1. Clean Install\n   - Remove node_modules and package-lock.json\n   - Run fresh npm install\n   - Verify installation success\n\n2. Check Package Integrity\n   - Verify dependency tree with npm ls\n   - Check for conflicts and unmet peer dependencies\n\n3. Run Linter\n   - Auto-detect linter from package.json scripts\n   - Execute linter and check results\n   - Attempt auto-fix if errors found\n   - Ask user if manual intervention needed\n\n4. Run Build\n   - Auto-detect build script (build, compile, dist)\n   - Execute build and verify success\n   - STOP if build fails (suggests breaking changes)\n   - Ask user about reverting if build breaks\n\n5. Run Tests (Optional)\n   - Check for test scripts\n   - Ask user if they want to run tests\n   - Document test results\n   - Determine if failures are acceptable\n\n6. Final Verification & Documentation\n   - Verify all checks passed\n   - Document results for report\n\n**Report Enhancements:**\n- Added Section 4: Verification Results table\n- Includes installation, linter, build, and test status\n- Detailed verification subsections with commands and results\n- Updated summary to include verification status line\n\n**Error Handling:**\n- Added Phase 4-specific error scenarios\n- npm install failures with cache clearing steps\n- Linter error handling and auto-fix attempts\n- Critical build failure handling with revert suggestions\n- Test failure assessment and user consultation\n\n**Updated Documentation:**\n- Response Approach now includes Phase 4 verification\n- Success Criteria includes all verification checks\n- Final Checklist expanded with Phase 4 requirements\n- Tool Usage section includes linting, building, testing commands\n- Report Generation Steps updated to collect Phase 4 data\n\nPhase 4 does NOT create a commit - it''s verification only.\nIf any check fails, agent stops and asks user for guidance.\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53d7bb164db8c9b574764e309986bf8c0ab68b35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/trees/53d7bb164db8c9b574764e309986bf8c0ab68b3