se npm ls to trace dependency paths\n- Add \"Remaining Vulnerabilities\" table for moderate/low severity issues\n- Clearly distinguish between direct and transitive dependencies\n\n**Commit Format Requirements:**\n- Extract Redmine task ID from branch name before creating commits\n- Use format: {Redmine task Id} - {commit title}\n- Stop and ask user for Redmine ID if not found in branch\n- Remove all AI and Claude Code references from agent-generated commits\n- Add detailed instructions for parsing branch names for task IDs\n\n**Enhanced Data Collection:**\n- Use npm audit --json to extract detailed vulnerability data\n- Document complete dependency paths for all vulnerable packages\n- Include examples of vulnerability data extraction and formatting\n\nUpdated phases 1, 2, and 3 to use new commit format.\nUpdated report template to include vulnerability IDs and transitive dependency information.\nAdded comprehensive final checklist covering all new requirements.\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d38e4addf78b771aa6609c7cc91ad1f1678f19dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/trees/d38e4addf78b771aa6609c7cc91ad1f1678f19dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/commits/0963bedd84849f440fdc0742552ce4ccd1d8d908","verification":{"payload":"tree d38e4addf78b771aa6609c7cc91ad1f1678f19dc\nparent 6768292146264771151df7f73c25ffabdd93c270\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761220067 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761220067 +0000\n\nfeat: enhance dependency health agent with vulnerability details and Redmine commit format\n\nUpdate dependency-health-checker agent to include:\n\n**Vulnerability Reporting Enhancements:**\n- Include CVE/GHSA advisory IDs in vulnerability tables\n- Add vulnerability descriptions for each security issue\n- Identify and document transitive dependencies with \"Installed by [parent]\" notes\n- Use npm ls to trace dependency paths\n- Add \"Remaining Vulnerabilities\" table for moderate/low severity issues\n- Clearly distinguish between direct and transitive dependencies\n\n**Commit Format Requirements:**\n- Extract Redmine task ID from branch name before creating commits\n- Use format: {Redmine task Id} - {commit title}\n- Stop and ask user for Redmine ID if not found in branch\n- Remove all AI and Claude Code references from agent-generated commits\n- Add detailed instructions for parsing branch names for task IDs\n\n**Enhanced Data Collection:**\n- Use npm audit --json to extract detailed vulnerability data\n- Document complete dependency paths for all vulnerable packages\n- Include examples of vulnerability data extraction and formatting\n\nUpdated phases 1, 2, and 3 to use new commit format.\nUpdated report template to include vulnerability IDs and transitive dependency information.\nAdded comprehensive final checklist covering all new requirements.\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL8rl0A3\nbrKF4qT1eHx+KRVwv89/g6xPjQY8QrctuwMhysha1a+c0eWmYp41q9JCKCqDjZfr/1t2bq5UBIP7\nBws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-23T11:47:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VX