and execution for complete dependency health check\n- Automatically invokes the dependency-health-checker agent\n- Performs all 4 phases: Node.js validation, security fixes, package updates, and reporting\n- Creates 3 separate commits during execution (one per phase)\n- Provides comprehensive documentation and usage examples\n\nThe command orchestrates the entire workflow autonomously:\n1. Node.js LTS version validation and .nvmrc updates\n2. Security vulnerability assessment and resolution\n3. Safe package updates with breaking change detection\n4. Comprehensive markdown report with status tables\n\nUsage:\n  /dependency-health::check-dependencies\n\nOr programmatically:\n  Command tool with command=\"dependency-health::check-dependencies\"\n\nThe agent stops and asks for user guidance when encountering:\n- Deprecated packages needing migration\n- Breaking changes in updates\n- Dependency conflicts\n- Ambiguous situations\n\nPerfect for routine maintenance, pre-release checks, or onboarding new projects.\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2601e1641bf7f58b5c26d20b52e91d437080a8b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/trees/2601e1641bf7f58b5c26d20b52e91d437080a8b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/commits/6768292146264771151df7f73c25ffabdd93c270","verification":{"payload":"tree 2601e1641bf7f58b5c26d20b52e91d437080a8b8\nparent fe46b0033880153a8a489e577ad1a0b16a7de252\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761215701 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761215701 +0000\n\nfeat: add dependency health check slash command\n\nAdd executable slash command for dependency health checking that can be invoked with:\n/dependency-health::check-dependencies\n\nFeatures:\n- Simple one-command execution for complete dependency health check\n- Automatically invokes the dependency-health-checker agent\n- Performs all 4 phases: Node.js validation, security fixes, package updates, and reporting\n- Creates 3 separate commits during execution (one per phase)\n- Provides comprehensive documentation and usage examples\n\nThe command orchestrates the entire workflow autonomously:\n1. Node.js LTS version validation and .nvmrc updates\n2. Security vulnerability assessment and resolution\n3. Safe package updates with breaking change detection\n4. Comprehensive markdown report with status tables\n\nUsage:\n  /dependency-health::check-dependencies\n\nOr programmatically:\n  Command tool with command=\"dependency-health::check-dependencies\"\n\nThe agent stops and asks for user guidance when encountering:\n- Deprecated packages needing migration\n- Breaking changes in updates\n- Dependency conflicts\n- Ambiguous situations\n\nPerfect for routine maintenance, pre-release checks, or onboarding new projects.\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKGyPOHf\nh5u5E0+FdNNNg3Vvv1evQfHxfyad3M0/eR/KLvttixgyHMqhdSvc5lgkzuZe5izg61rC1poXxyqI\nNwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-23T10:35:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"h