c"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/fe46b0033880153a8a489e577ad1a0b16a7de252/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:29:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:29:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: add dependency health check agent\n\nAdd comprehensive dependency health checking agent that performs:\n- Node.js LTS version validation with automatic .nvmrc updates\n- Security vulnerability assessment and resolution\n- Safe package updates with breaking change analysis\n- Detailed reporting with status indicators\n\nThe agent follows a methodical 4-phase approach:\n1. Node version validation (with commit)\n2. Security vulnerability resolution (with commit)\n3. Package updates to minor/patch versions (with commit)\n4. Comprehensive markdown report generation\n\nKey features:\n- Stops and asks for guidance when encountering ambiguity\n- Identifies deprecated packages with recommendations\n- Checks for breaking changes before applying updates\n- Creates separate commits for each phase\n- Verifies completion of each step before proceeding\n\nUsage: Invoke with Task tool using subagent_type=\"dependency-health::dependency-health-checker\"\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd0dc5e6655c83524fcd5a81c201db8f6b054058","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/trees/cd0dc5e6655c83524fcd5a81c201db8f6b054058"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/commits/fe46b0033880153a8a489e577ad1a0b16a7de252","verification":{"payload":"tree cd0dc5e6655c83524fcd5a81c201db8f6b054058\nparent 81e86f700c07ab1a8081dbde6afbf7817bd77ea8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761215380 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761215380 +0000\n\nfeat: add dependency health check agent\n\nAdd comprehensive dependency health checking agent that performs:\n- Node.js LTS version validation with automatic .nvmrc updates\n- Security vulnerability assessment and resolution\n- Safe package updates with breaking change analysis\n- Detailed reporting with status indicators\n\nThe agent follows a methodical 4-phase approach:\n1. Node version validation (with commit)\n2. Security vulnerability resolution (with commit)\n3. Package updates to minor/patch versions (with commit)\n4. Comprehensive markdown report generation\n\nKey features:\n- Stops and asks for guidance when encountering ambiguity\n- Identifies deprecated packages with recommendations\n- Checks for breaking changes before applying updates\n- Creates separate commits for each phase\n- Verifies completion of each step before proceeding\n\nUsage: Invoke with Task tool using subagent_type=\"dependency-health::dependency-health-checker\"\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC/ZQ+KM\nnvnb7Of1bmnDvV++D1d5ZwxoGLiGghmSCRmQAnKTRX6CevwXOU5V/lnczhf7jIF2jQwaY/Gdfxan\nTAE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-23T10:29:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com