:"https://github.com/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commit/29c85e175228830a810429f3606842824ee62235","sha":"29c85e175228830a810429f3606842824ee62235","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/29c85e175228830a810429f3606842824ee62235"}],"sha":"81e86f700c07ab1a8081dbde6afbf7817bd77ea8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/81e86f700c07ab1a8081dbde6afbf7817bd77ea8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/29c85e175228830a810429f3606842824ee62235/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T15:17:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T15:17:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add comprehensive PR review plugin with automated quality and security analysis\n\nThis commit introduces a new pr-review plugin that provides automated pull request review capabilities with technology detection, code quality analysis, security auditing, and build verification.\n\nFeatures:\n- New plugin: pr-review (v0.0.1)\n- Technology detector agent: Automatically identifies project technologies and frameworks\n- PR reviewer agent: Performs comprehensive code quality analysis with technology-specific insights\n- Review pull request command: 6-phase review workflow orchestrating all review aspects\n\nKey capabilities:\n- Phase 1: PR information gathering (fetch PR details, changes, commits)\n- Phase 2: Technology detection (identify frameworks, languages, patterns)\n- Phase 3: Code quality review (best practices, maintainability, testing)\n- Phase 4: Security audit (OWASP Top 10, vulnerability scanning)\n- Phase 5: Lint & build verification (automated quality gates)\n- Phase 6: Review summary & publishing (consolidated report with recommendations)\n\nThe review generates structured feedback with:\n- Severity levels (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW/NITPICK)\n- Specific file:line references for all issues\n- Code examples showing current vs suggested fixes\n- Technology-specific best practices\n- Security compliance assessment\n- Final recommendation (APPROVE/REQUEST CHANGES/COMMENT/BLOCKED)\n\nUpdated documentation:\n- Added comprehensive PR review workflow section to README\n- Updated installation instructions to include pr-review plugin\n- Added usage examples and review output documentation\n- Updated version to 0.0.3\n\nDependencies:\n- Requires security-compliance plugin for security auditing\n\nUsage:\n/review-pull-request <PR_NUMBER> [--focus=security|quality|all]\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c27fc1ef09e7445f70bb141f9e0717961f4aa58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/trees/7c27fc1ef09e7445f70bb141f9e0717961f4aa58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/git/commits/29c85e175228830a810429f3606842824ee62235","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c27fc1ef09e7445f70bb141f9e0717961f4aa58\nparent fd5b72ba8216afe455810b0a33fbbe96d10b38b4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761146258 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761146258 +0000\n\nAdd comprehensive PR review plugin with automated quality and security analysis\n\nThis commit introduces a new pr-review plugin that provides automated pull request review capabilities with technology detection, code quality analysis, security auditing, and build verification.\n\nFeatures:\n- New plugin: pr-review (v0.0.1)\n- Technology detector agent: Automatically identifies project technologies and frameworks\n- PR reviewer agent: Performs comprehensive code quality analysis with technology-specific insights\n- Review pull request command: 6-phase review workflow orchestrating all review aspects\n\nKey capabilities:\n- Phase 1: PR information gathering (fetch PR details, changes, commits)\n- Phase 2: Technology detection (identify frameworks, languages, patterns)\n- Phase 3: Code quality review (best practices, maintainability, testing)\n- Phase 4: Security audit (OWASP Top 10, vulnerability scanning)\n- Phase 5: Lint & build verification (automated quality gates)\n- Phase 6: Review summary & publishing (consolidated report with recommendations)\n\nThe review generates structured feedback with:\n- Severity levels (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW/NITPICK)\n- Specific file:line references for all issues\n- Code examples showing current vs suggested fixes\n- Technology-specific best practices\n- Security compliance assessment\n- Final recommendation (APPROVE/REQUEST CHANGES/COMMENT/BLOCKED)\n\nUpdated documentation:\n- Added comprehensive PR review workflow section to README\n- Updated installation instructions to include pr-review plugin\n- Added usage examples and review output documentation\n- Updated version to 0.0.3\n\nDependencies:\n- Requires security-compliance plugin for security auditing\n\nUsage:\n/review-pull-request <PR_NUMBER> [--focus=security|quality|all]\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNdSBIjx\nFhRQiNuOQosT2xRdDAN91xAMuheHsuGWuxyoW/MDidVMC5M8MQfPd5PSQEiMpo1DadySM7SgXpkd\ngwQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-22T15:17:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commit/29c85e175228830a810429f3606842824ee62235","node_id":"C_kwDOQELQTNoAKDI5Yzg1ZTE3NTIyODgzMGE4MTA0MjlmMzYwNjg0MjgyNGVlNjIyMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commit/fd5b72ba8216afe455810b0a33fbbe96d10b38b4","sha":"fd5b72ba8216afe455810b0a33fbbe96d10b38b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitorosabrooktec/brooktec-claude-orchestration-test/commits/fd5b72b